I uploaded a video to youtube showing what nethack can be like with sounds added
for almost every event!

The video shows a new character exploring the dungeon in nethack with full
sounds! I have added over 300 unique sounds to the game with over 500 event
triggers. I plan on creating more videos to let people preview what nethack can
be like with sounds added.

I also plan on making these sounds and the necessary config file additions
available to download at some point when I have time. If you really like the
sounds and want to try them right away, feel free to email me at
dungeonsounds@gmail.com and I'd be happy to send them to you and help you out.

I should also mention that this is the windows tile version of the game, and not
all versions of Nethack can support sounds. I increased the message text size to
make it easier to view on youtube. Also I played this tourist in a way I thought
a tourist might act, to hopefully make the video a bit more interesting. I
wouldn't recommend half the actions he took! =P

